# terminal keys as c delivers them: Shift+letter is the capital, Shift+digit
# or punctuation is layout-dependent, Ctrl+@ is NUL (never delivered), and
# Ctrl+h/i/j/[ are the BackSpace/Tab/Return/Escape runes
k init
k defaults
k add Shift+a hold
k look 1 41
k look 0 61
k add Shift+1 hold
k add Shift+minus hold
k add Ctrl+@ hold
k add Ctrl+j newline
k add Ctrl+i tab
k add Ctrl+[ hold
k add Ctrl+h backspace
k add Ctrl+m newline
k look 0 A
k look 0 D
k dump
